This directory contains the
[Molecule](https://docs.ansible.com/projects/molecule/) scenarios of this
project:

- `default` tests the project on several Linux distributions, in Podman
  containers or QEMU/KVM virtual machines.
- `ee` builds an Ansible execution environment (EE) with
  [`ansible-builder`](https://docs.ansible.com/projects/builder/en/latest/)
  and checks that the project is included.

Paths are relative to this directory unless stated otherwise.



